# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Two tests read the crate's own source — the coded-enum registry and the
# wire-format scan — and a `\r` in the middle of a line-shaped pattern makes
# them report the wrong thing rather than fail loudly. Normalising at checkout
# removes the class.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep the proptest regression seeds byte-stable: they are read back verbatim.
*.proptest-regressions text eol=lf
